---
/**
 * Headless preview for Wagtail editors (wagtail-headless-preview).
 * Wagtail opens /preview/?content_type=...&token=... ; the page is fetched client-side
 * from the CMS, so this route stays static and no draft content lands in the build.
 * The actual rendering happens in the PreviewClient island which re-uses the same
 * block components via a small SSR endpoint – see docs/03-technik.md "Preview".
 */
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
import { getNavigation, getSettings } from "@/lib/wagtail";
const [settings, nav] = await Promise.all([getSettings(), getNavigation()]);
---
<Base settings={settings} nav={nav} title="Vorschau" path="/preview/" noindex>
  <section class="section"><div class="container-x prose-site">
    <h1>Vorschau</h1>
    <p>Die Live-Vorschau für Redakteure wird in Phase 2 fertiggestellt (Aufgabe „Preview-Route“ in <code>docs/04-aufgaben.md</code>). Bis dahin: Seite veröffentlichen, der Rebuild dauert ca. eine Minute.</p>
  </div></section>
</Base>
